---
/**
 * Home 02 "How it works" (Paper ALP-0 desktop, BIV-0 phone): head, then three
 * step cards. Each card has a small app mock (HTML/CSS, described by an
 * aria-label) above the step title and copy.
 */
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="section how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="container section__stack">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-head__title">
        <p class="overline">How it works</p>
        <h2 id="how-title" class="display-l">Set it up once. Every payment adds itself.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-head__intro intro">
        <span class="how__intro-wide">Takes about three minutes. No bank login, no statements to upload, nothing to type.</span>
        <span class="how__intro-narrow">Takes about three minutes. No bank login, nothing to type.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps" role="list">
      <li class="card step" data-reveal>
        <div
          class="mock"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Bank emails in a list. Emirates NBD, Purchase of AED 64.50 at TALABAT, marked Read. DIB, Card transaction AED 214.30 Lulu, marked Read. Weekend plans? From a friend, marked Not fetched."
        >
          <div class="row">
            <span class="row__dot row__dot--on"></span>
            <span class="row__text"><b>Emirates NBD</b><small>Purchase of AED 64.50 at TALABAT</small></span>
            <span class="pill pill--read">Read</span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <span class="row__dot row__dot--on"></span>
            <span class="row__text"><b>DIB</b><small>Card transaction AED 214.30 Lulu</small></span>
            <span class="pill pill--read">Read</span>
          </div>
          <div class="row row--dim">
            <span class="row__dot"></span>
            <span class="row__text"><b>Weekend plans?</b><small>From a friend</small></span>
            <span class="pill">Not fetched</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step__copy">
          <div class="step__head">
            <span class="coin-badge">1</span>
            <h3 class="step__title">Connect your email</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Give Hasala read‑only access to your email. Your iPhone downloads only the emails from your bank, never the rest of your inbox.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="card step" data-reveal>
        <div
          class="mock"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Three payments with categories. Talabat, Dining · Wants, 64.50. Lulu Hypermarket, Groceries · Needs, 214.30. Salary, Income, +25,000.00."
        >
          <div class="row">
            <span class="hue hue--lilac">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 1.5v4.2a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 3.2 0V1.5M5.6 1.5v13M11.5 14.5V1.5c-1.8.6-2.6 2.6-2.6 4.8 0 1.6.9 2.4 2.6 2.4"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="row__text"><b>Talabat</b><small>Dining · Wants</small></span>
            <span class="amt">64.50</span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <span class="hue hue--sand">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 6h12l-1.3 7.2a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.3H4.8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5-1.3L2 6ZM5.5 6l2-4M10.5 6l-2-4"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="row__text"><b>Lulu Hypermarket</b><small>Groceries · Needs</small></span>
            <span class="amt">214.30</span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <span class="hue hue--sky">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="2" y="4.5" width="12" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M5.5 4.5V3.2A1.2 1.2 0 0 1 6.7 2h2.6a1.2 1.2 0 0 1 1.2 1.2v1.3"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="row__text"><b>Salary</b><small>Income</small></span>
            <span class="amt amt--in">+25,000.00</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step__copy">
          <div class="step__head">
            <span class="coin-badge">2</span>
            <h3 class="step__title">Sorted for you</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Each bank email becomes a payment with a category, like Dining or Groceries. Fix one, and Hasala remembers your pick for the shop and suggests it next time.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="card step" data-reveal>
        <div
          class="mock mock--lock"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Talabat · Dining, 64.50, locked with your key, stored on our server as 8f3a c91e 0b7d 52e4 a6f0 1d9c 77b2."
        >
          <div class="lockrow">
            <b>Talabat · Dining</b>
            <span class="amt">64.50</span>
          </div>
          <span class="tick"></span>
          <span class="keypill">
            <span class="keypill__icon">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3.5" y="8" width="11" height="8" rx="2.2"/><path d="M5.8 8V5.8a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 6.4 0V8"/></svg>
            </span>
            Locked with your key
          </span>
          <span class="tick"></span>
          <div class="stored">
            <code>8f3a c91e 0b7d 52e4 a6f0 1d9c 77b2</code>
            <small>What our server stores</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step__copy">
          <div class="step__head">
            <span class="coin-badge">3</span>
            <h3 class="step__title">Locked, then backed up</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Before your data leaves your phone, it's locked with a key only your devices have. We keep the locked copy and can't open it.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    --section-pt: 24px;
    --section-pb: 88px;
  }
  .how__intro-wide {
    display: none;
  }
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .step {
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .step__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .step__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .step__title {
    font-size: var(--t-card-title);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.24;
  }
  .step__copy p {
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 23px;
  }

  /* App mocks */
  .mock {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--r-card);
    background: var(--white);
    box-shadow: rgb(0 0 0 / 4%) 0 1px 2px;
  }
  .mock b {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 20px;
  }
  .mock small {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 18px;
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-block: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
  }
  .row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .row--dim {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .row__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .row__dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--neutral-300);
  }
  .row__dot--on {
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .pill {
    flex: none;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: var(--neutral-100);
    color: var(--neutral-600);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 16px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pill--read {
    background: var(--success-surface);
    color: var(--success);
  }
  .hue {
    display: flex;
    flex: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 18px;
  }
  .hue--lilac {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--hue-lilac-start), var(--hue-lilac-end));
    color: var(--hue-lilac-ink);
  }
  .hue--sand {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--hue-sand-start), var(--hue-sand-end));
    color: var(--hue-sand-ink);
  }
  .hue--sky {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--hue-sky-start), var(--hue-sky-end));
    color: var(--hue-sky-ink);
  }
  .amt {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-figure);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 20px;
  }
  .amt--in {
    color: var(--money-in);
  }

  .mock--lock {
    gap: 10px;
    padding-block: 18px;
  }
  .lockrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r-field);
    background: var(--neutral-50);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--neutral-200);
  }
  .tick {
    align-self: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 1px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--neutral-300);
  }
  .keypill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    align-self: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px 6px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--hue-mint-start), var(--hue-mint-end));
    color: var(--hue-mint-ink);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 18px;
  }
  .keypill__icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 70%);
  }
  .stored {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r-field);
    background: var(--ink-900);
  }
  .stored code {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 86%);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 18px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .stored small {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 60%);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 16px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .step__copy p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 25px;
    }
    .how__intro-wide {
      display: inline;
    }
    .how__intro-narrow {
      display: none;
    }
    .section-head__intro {
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .how {
      --section-pt: 120px;
      --section-pb: 140px;
    }
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .step {
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .mock {
      height: 236px;
    }
    .mock--lock {
      padding-block: 18px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 1180px) and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .stored code {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
  }
</style>
